# Python tooling artifacts (tools/** — pytest, compileall, ruff)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# особисті вкладення, що потрапляють у корінь із чату — НЕ версіонуються
image-*.jpg
image-*.png

# [INF.20] `google-github-actions/auth` writes its short-lived WIF credential file
# INTO the workspace (`/home/runner/work/<repo>/<repo>/gha-creds-*.json`) — measured
# run 33499357498, where it made the checkout dirty and `.kamal/hooks/pre-build`
# aborted the deploy. Two costs, and the loud one is not the expensive one: the
# aborted deploy is visible, a credential file sitting untracked in the working tree
# is not. `git add -A` would stage it.
gha-creds-*.json
